(D-033, D-050). Each was fetched once, on 2026-11-03, from a Fontsource npm package at an
exact version through its jsDelivr mirror, in its Latin subset; public/fonts/fonts.json
pins every file and its source by SHA-256. Two files are Modified Versions, made with
fontTools 4.60.1 as fonts.json records. The licence beside each face is the LICENSE file
